          "settings": {
            "heading": "Custom CNC Milling Services and Applications",
            "enable_h1_tag": false,
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "description": "<p>Whether machining aluminum housings, stainless steel components, or tight-tolerance hydraulic fittings, this mill is built for high-performance output.</p><ul><li>Mill part sizes up to: Length: 40\", Width: 20\", Height: 16\"</li><li>Tolerances held to ±0.005\"</li><li>Complex features: pocketing, profiling, counterboring, countersinking</li><li>Materials: carbon steel, stainless steel, aluminum, specialty alloys</li><li>Industries served: OEM manufacturing, automotive, material handling, industrial equipment, prototyping</li></ul><p>From replacement parts to aftermarket components, our CNC milling services cover a range of use cases. We specialize in parts that require both durability and precision, helping clients improve system performance, extend equipment lifespan, and bring new designs to life.</p>",
            "desktop_content_position": "start-md",
            "desktop_content_alignment": "ta-left-md top-md",
