            "heading_size": "h3",
            "description": "<p>CNC milling is just one aspect of our full-service machining operation. We also offer turning, boring, drilling, threading, and more, all performed in-house for total quality control. With a full complement of tooling and experienced machinists, we’re equipped to handle both short-run and large-scale orders with efficiency and reliability.</p><ul><li>CNC Lathe and Mill Capabilities</li><li>Material flexibility for any job</li><li>Precision across tight tolerances</li><li>Full support for OEMs, engineers, and manufacturers</li><li>Integrated services for complete part manufacturing</li></ul>",
